        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for evolution fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in evolution:\n\n- CVE-2026-88859: JavaScript handler incorrectly assigns an\n  attacker-controlled JavaScript URL to an iframe's source when\n  processing a crafted HTML email containing a spoofed vCard\n  control, which can lead to arbitrary JavaScript execution (bsc#1280004)\n",
